{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd9d <strong>About Raccoon Valley</strong> \ud83e\udd9d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > OK so picture this. A tiny raccoon village, totally abandoned. Crumbling houses, overgrown paths, nobody home. Pretty sad right? BUT THAT'S WHERE YOU COME IN. You're gonna dig stuff up, fix everything, and turn this whole place into the cutest little town ever. Trust me, it's gonna be great.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/8331032be9b55cc97c33c351227a96bc.poster.avif?t=1774305011\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/8331032be9b55cc97c33c351227a96bc.webm?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/8331032be9b55cc97c33c351227a96bc.mp4?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First you dig. Like, really dig. Go underground, crack open rocks, find all sorts of shiny things the village needs. Then you vacuum up these MASSIVE piles of loot and watch everything bounce and roll and tumble all over the place. It's so satisfying I could cry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/4072de3978f558885e64b741bfd99aa0.poster.avif?t=1774305011\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/4072de3978f558885e64b741bfd99aa0.webm?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/4072de3978f558885e64b741bfd99aa0.mp4?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you take all that stuff and fix up houses, unlock upgrades, and slowly grow this place into a proper cozy raccoon neighborhood. Oh and you can drop raccoons from the sky. And give them hats. Just... just try it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/6e87c12788d4c6ed421dd9736960dd0b.poster.avif?t=1774305011\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/6e87c12788d4c6ed421dd9736960dd0b.webm?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/6e87c12788d4c6ed421dd9736960dd0b.mp4?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also I'm here. Hi. I'm Feely. I'm helping. I definitely don't know anything about why the village was abandoned or where the King went. Nope. Nothing suspicious here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd9d <strong>Built to be the most fun clicker you've ever touched</strong> \ud83e\udd9d</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of hand-crafted animations, everything reacts, bounces, and feels alive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 items to discover and collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based resources that pile up, tumble, and fly across your screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny NPC interactions, drop raccoons, toss hats, poke everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full village to restore from ruins to glory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious story hiding beneath the surface (I said too much)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/52c8d9bd7a71f20aabe38f46e9454b30.poster.avif?t=1774305011\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/52c8d9bd7a71f20aabe38f46e9454b30.webm?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/52c8d9bd7a71f20aabe38f46e9454b30.mp4?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/219694de0eaadad3c17a360ceadc18e8.poster.avif?t=1774305011\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/219694de0eaadad3c17a360ceadc18e8.webm?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/219694de0eaadad3c17a360ceadc18e8.mp4?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/8226ba9466cf3b10674613a6b0df0e57.poster.avif?t=1774305011\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/8226ba9466cf3b10674613a6b0df0e57.webm?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/8226ba9466cf3b10674613a6b0df0e57.mp4?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>P.S. If you find a golden donut underground, that's mine. I dropped it. Please give it back. It's not related to the missing King or anything. Stop asking.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814730?t=1774305011","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/a1c3445a62d9051820071199b248b83881f8c734/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774305011","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/648efd47f2a29c7a3b1e87b341db8707eb05e362/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774305011","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/648efd47f2a29c7a3b1e87b341db8707eb05e362/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774305011","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd9d <strong>About Raccoon Valley</strong> \ud83e\udd9d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > OK so picture this. A tiny raccoon village, totally abandoned. Crumbling houses, overgrown paths, nobody home. Pretty sad right? BUT THAT'S WHERE YOU COME IN. You're gonna dig stuff up, fix everything, and turn this whole place into the cutest little town ever. Trust me, it's gonna be great.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/8331032be9b55cc97c33c351227a96bc.poster.avif?t=1774305011\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/8331032be9b55cc97c33c351227a96bc.webm?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/8331032be9b55cc97c33c351227a96bc.mp4?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First you dig. Like, really dig. Go underground, crack open rocks, find all sorts of shiny things the village needs. Then you vacuum up these MASSIVE piles of loot and watch everything bounce and roll and tumble all over the place. It's so satisfying I could cry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/4072de3978f558885e64b741bfd99aa0.poster.avif?t=1774305011\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/4072de3978f558885e64b741bfd99aa0.webm?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/4072de3978f558885e64b741bfd99aa0.mp4?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you take all that stuff and fix up houses, unlock upgrades, and slowly grow this place into a proper cozy raccoon neighborhood. Oh and you can drop raccoons from the sky. And give them hats. Just... just try it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/6e87c12788d4c6ed421dd9736960dd0b.poster.avif?t=1774305011\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/6e87c12788d4c6ed421dd9736960dd0b.webm?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/6e87c12788d4c6ed421dd9736960dd0b.mp4?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also I'm here. Hi. I'm Feely. I'm helping. I definitely don't know anything about why the village was abandoned or where the King went. Nope. Nothing suspicious here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd9d <strong>Built to be the most fun clicker you've ever touched</strong> \ud83e\udd9d</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of hand-crafted animations, everything reacts, bounces, and feels alive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 items to discover and collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based resources that pile up, tumble, and fly across your screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny NPC interactions, drop raccoons, toss hats, poke everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full village to restore from ruins to glory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious story hiding beneath the surface (I said too much)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/52c8d9bd7a71f20aabe38f46e9454b30.poster.avif?t=1774305011\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/52c8d9bd7a71f20aabe38f46e9454b30.webm?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/52c8d9bd7a71f20aabe38f46e9454b30.mp4?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/219694de0eaadad3c17a360ceadc18e8.poster.avif?t=1774305011\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/219694de0eaadad3c17a360ceadc18e8.webm?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/219694de0eaadad3c17a360ceadc18e8.mp4?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/8226ba9466cf3b10674613a6b0df0e57.poster.avif?t=1774305011\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/8226ba9466cf3b10674613a6b0df0e57.webm?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/extras/8226ba9466cf3b10674613a6b0df0e57.mp4?t=1774305011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>P.S. If you find a golden donut underground, that's mine. I dropped it. Please give it back. It's not related to the missing King or anything. Stop asking.</i></p>","developers":["Dumivid"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814730/12fa09cb0af48f12729b33c650755aefaf091826/header.jpg?t=1774305011","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814730/372086245/8d73bab06e461e8043fd68f5559e82c9c98c2fa5/1760204195/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760208826","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814730/372086245/8d73bab06e461e8043fd68f5559e82c9c98c2fa5/1760204195/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760208826","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814